WEBVTT

00:45:55.946 --> 00:46:00.067
And one particular insight
came out of that

00:46:00.091 --> 00:46:02.781
that I think has driven your thinking.

00:46:02.805 --> 00:46:04.895
KFL: Yes, when I faced death,

00:46:04.919 --> 00:46:09.910
what I realized was
that in my whole career,

00:46:09.934 --> 00:46:14.007
I basically was a workaholic,

00:46:14.031 --> 00:46:16.236
like all the Chinese entrepreneurs.

00:46:16.260 --> 00:46:18.617
I was their founder,
but I worked just as hard.

00:46:18.641 --> 00:46:20.514
I worked 80 hours a week,

00:46:20.538 --> 00:46:24.387
and work became the meaning of my life.

00:46:24.411 --> 00:46:26.506
When I faced possible death,

00:46:26.530 --> 00:46:31.656
what I realized was, work isn't
the most important thing for me.